OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fwindy and some showers continuing to
OL,7,Fpush in from the west, more in the way
OL,8,Fof clear spells for Ayrshire. Feeling
OL,9,Fquite chilly in any sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FWinds gradually easing during
OL,12,Fthe day and some Autumn sunshine for
OL,13,Fmost areas, any showers in the west
OL,14,Fbecoming isolated. Quite a pleasant
OL,15,Fafternoon before cloud spreading east
OL,16,Fin evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
