OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,6,FMonday morning, becoming much warmer
OL,7,Fbut cloudy with further patchy rain.
OL,8,FMild with some showers on Tuesday,
OL,9,Fthen rain arriving later. Rain clears
OL,10,FWednesday with bright spells, showers
OL,11,Flater.
